PRD - Reguhub Application:

1. Product Overview:
   - Name: Reguhub
   - Description: A comprehensive regulatory compliance and project management platform
   - Target Users: Organizations, compliance officers, project managers, and team members
   - Key Value Proposition: Streamlined regulatory compliance management and project tracking

2. Core Features:
   a. Authentication & Authorization:
      - Multi-factor authentication
      - Role-based access control (Admin, Manager, Worker)
      - Organization-level permissions
      - Session management and security

   b. Dashboard:
      - Project overview with status indicators
      - Recent activity feed
      - Quick access to important documents
      - Compliance status metrics
      - Team member availability

   c. Project Management:
      - Project creation and configuration
      - Task assignment and tracking
      - File upload and management
      - Progress tracking and reporting
      - Team collaboration tools

   d. Compliance Management:
      - Regulatory requirement tracking
      - Document version control
      - Audit trail maintenance
      - Compliance status reporting
      - Automated compliance checks

3. Technical Requirements:
   a. Frontend:
      - React-based SPA
      - Responsive design for all devices
      - Material-UI components
      - Real-time updates
      - Offline capabilities

   b. Backend:
      - Node.js/Express server
      - RESTful API architecture
      - WebSocket support for real-time features
      - Rate limiting and security measures
      - Caching implementation

   c. Database:
      - Supabase for data storage
      - Real-time subscriptions
      - Data backup and recovery
      - Data encryption at rest

   d. Storage:
      - Cloudflare R2 for file storage
      - File versioning
      - Access control
      - CDN integration

4. Security Requirements:
   - End-to-end encryption
   - Regular security audits
   - GDPR compliance
   - Data retention policies
   - Secure file storage
   - API authentication
   - Input validation
   - XSS protection
   - CSRF protection

5. Performance Requirements:
   - Page load time < 2 seconds
   - API response time < 200ms
   - 99.9% uptime
   - Support for 1000+ concurrent users
   - Efficient file upload/download
   - Optimized database queries

6. Integration Requirements:
   - Email notifications
   - Calendar integration
   - Document management systems
   - Reporting tools
   - Analytics integration
   - API for third-party integrations

7. User Experience:
   - Intuitive navigation
   - Consistent design language
   - Accessibility compliance
   - Mobile-first approach
   - Clear error messages
   - Helpful tooltips
   - Keyboard shortcuts

8. Monitoring and Analytics:
   - User activity tracking
   - Performance monitoring
   - Error logging
   - Usage analytics
   - Security monitoring
   - Compliance reporting

9. Deployment and DevOps:
   - CI/CD pipeline
   - Automated testing
   - Environment management
   - Backup procedures
   - Disaster recovery
   - Monitoring and alerting

10. Future Considerations:
    - AI-powered compliance suggestions
    - Advanced analytics dashboard
    - Mobile application
    - API marketplace
    - Integration marketplace
    - Advanced reporting features
